      {
        "id": 17661,
        "title": "setInterval y clearInterval",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> es otro método nativo de JavaScript que ejecuta código de forma asíncrona.</p><p>Con <code>setInterval</code> podemos ejecutar una pequeña parte de un bucle de juego cada cierto período de tiempo. Aprendamos más sobre este método.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> toma una función de callback y un intervalo como parámetros. Aquí, <code>toggleInvincibility</code> alterna la invencibilidad del jugador encendida y apagada.</p><p>Pasa la función de callback y el intervalo a la llamada de <code>setInterval</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"217\" endIndex=\"228\" /><option startIndex=\"229\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>setInterval</code> seguido de <code>toggleInvincibility</code> y finalmente <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval</code> ejecuta la función de callback indefinidamente, con un retraso del número especificado de milisegundos que pasamos como segundo parámetro.</p><p>La primera ejecución del callback ocurre después del tiempo especificado. No se ejecuta inmediatamente.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si ejecutamos el código, podríamos obtener un error de tiempo de espera porque no hay un alto para el <code>setInterval</code>.</p><p>¡Agrega <code>500</code> milisegundos aquí para ver el power-up parpadear para siempre cada <code>500</code> milisegundos!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"218\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para detener <code>setInterval()</code> de ejecutarse indefinidamente, podemos usar el método <code>clearInterval</code>.<br /></p><p>Podemos guardar el <code>setInterval</code> en una variable <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>. Luego usa <code>clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval)</code> dentro de un <code>setTimeout</code> para que se ejecute después de <code>2500</code> milisegundos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"340\" endIndex=\"344\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>let</code> seguido de <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> y luego <code>clearInterval</code>, <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>, <code>2500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El método <code>clearInterval()</code> toma el <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> como su único parámetro.</p><p>Al ejecutarse, detiene la acción repetitiva del método <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>clearInterval</code> seguido de <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
